{"amount_text": "除却に要した工事費の3分の1(上限50万円)", "checked_on": "2026-09-15", "first_seen_at": "2026-09-14T23:57:51+00:00", "history": [{"at": "2026-09-14T23:57:51+00:00", "event": "created"}], "kind": "解体", "kind_quote": null, "last_seen_at": "2026-09-14T23:57:51+00:00", "name": "空き家除却補助金", "period_end": null, "period_text": "10月31日(休日の場合は翌開庁日)までに申請。予算の上限に達し次第、募集を終了", "provenance": {"content_hash": "sha256:96954690bb35e6601b9c32e729149df160fcb1cc9dac22f295f056626a5dca2a", "extractor": {"cached": false, "extracted_at": "2026-09-14T23:57:51Z", "input_tokens": 3959, "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "output_tokens": 194, "prompt_version": "subsidy_v1", "provider": "anthropic"}, "fetched_at": "2026-09-14T23:57:38Z", "license": null, "page_kind": "subsidy", "source_url": "https://www.town.tomika.gifu.jp/docs/692387.html"}, "record_id": "c1e05efe17f01d62", "scope": "空き家", "source_id": "gifu-215023", "status": "active", "summary": "町内の不良空き家を解体して更地にする場合、工事費の3分の1（上限50万円）を補助。昭和56年以前建築で不良度評点100点以上の空き家が対象。", "url": "https://www.town.tomika.gifu.jp/docs/692387.html", "year_text": null}
